      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "例2 设$x\\approx0.823$，$y\\approx1.34$（在写出的近似数中，所有",
        "数字都是可靠数字），计算式$\\frac{xy}{x+y}$的值，"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "1. 求出积$xy$的近似值："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$xy\\approx0.823\\times1.34=1.10282\\approx1.103$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "（在$x$与$y$的近似值中，都有三个有效数字。所得结果保留",
        "四个数字；有一个数字是备用数字。）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "2. 求出和$x+y$的近似值："
